1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Arise with strength! For we have raised our flag,

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:14,000
The flag which has cost us dear, With extremes of thirst and pain.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Our flag, whose colours are the everlasting green of the earth,

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,000
The blue of the sky, and white, the color of peace.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,000
And in the center the red star of blood.

6
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:37,000
Oh flag of ours, what a glorious sight!